  "description": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\"><span style=\"color: rgb(178, 105, 105);\">&ldquo;Secrets About You&rdquo;</span> is excited to offer an affiliate program for our unique Tarot Numerology services!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>We offer a unique opportunity for individuals and businesses to partner with us and earn commissions for promoting our services. For every successful sale made through your unique affiliate link, you will earn a commission of 40%. We use reliable affiliate tracking software to ensure that every sale made through your link is accurately tracked and recorded, and you will receive a monthly commission payment for all of your sales.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue'; min-height: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">As an affiliate, you will receive a unique link to our website, which you can share on your website, blog, social media platforms, or email list.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue'; min-height: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">Our Tarot Numerology services are unique and offer valuable insights into your life program, karmic program and future. By promoting our services to your audience, you will be helping them to gain clarity, insight, and guidance in their lives. Plus, you'll be earning a commission for every sale you make!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue'; min-height: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">As a special bonus, we also offer a free Tarot Numerology reading to all of our affiliates. This will help you better understand our services and offer more personalised recommendations to your audience. Just reach out to us for any reading free of charge at readings@secrets-about-you.com.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue'; min-height: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">Join us today and start earning commissions while helping others!</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue'; min-height: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\">If you have any questions or would like to become an affiliate, please contact us at readings@secrets-about-you.com.</p>",
